    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d741-a2">

                <pb facs="1188" n="1092" sameAs="frus:frus1874/pg1092"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 2 in No. 19.]</seg></opener>
                <p>[See list of crew captured in dispatch No. 107, dated December 4, 1873, Santiago
                    de Cuba.]</p>
                <p>The remainder of those on board were sent to jail on the 4th, and thence by the
                    Bazan, on the same night, to Cienfuegos, and thence by rail to Havana—ninety-two
                    of all nations; ten left at the hospital sick, who will also go to Havana as
                    soon as recovered, making, all told, one hundred and two men.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
